      "created_at": "2014-01-02T15:43:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I recenty discovered that The Scholar's Forms are not Limited.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I also recently found out that Unity's golems specify that they cannot be played during <strong><em>her</em></strong> play phase, meaning team members like Omnitron-X and Argent Adept can be amazing at getting her rolling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And just yesterday, going through Chrono Ranger's deck, I noticed that the Bounty Card with Plague Rat on it (forget the name) let's Jim use a Power whenever the target the bounty is attached to attacks.&nbsp; I have no idea how I missed that for so long.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What rules or specific card text have you discovered lately that make you say \"Well...that would have made all those earlier games a helluva lot easier\" ?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:55.882Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
