      "raw": "<p>I recenty discovered that The Scholar&#39;s Forms are not Limited.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I also recently found out that Unity&#39;s golems specify that they cannot be played during <strong><em>her</em></strong> play phase, meaning team members like Omnitron-X and Argent Adept can be amazing at getting her rolling.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And just yesterday, going through Chrono Ranger&#39;s deck, I noticed that the Bounty Card with Plague Rat on it (forget the name) let&#39;s Jim use a Power whenever the target the bounty is attached to attacks.&nbsp; I have no idea how I missed that for so long.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What rules or specific card text have you discovered lately that make you say &quot;Well...that would have made all those earlier games a helluva lot easier&quot; ?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
