      "raw": "<p>This is only half on-topic because it pertains to art rather than gameplay, but I just noticed for the first time where exactly the pupil of Wraith&#39;s right eye (on the left side of her face as we see it) is in the picture for Grappling Hook.&nbsp; I always saw this picture as showing her looking kinda googley-eyed or cross-eyed, because I thought the dark shadow in the lower-right corner of the eye was her pupil; instead, it&#39;s her <em>nose</em>, and the pupil is red-tinged from backlighting and visible at the upper-left edge of the eye, making it look like she&#39;s sighting a far-distant object with intention to grapple-hook it.&nbsp; This obviously makes much more sense than my previous interpretation, but makes the card as a whole somewhat less hilarious to me.</p>",
