      "raw": "[quote=\"McBehrer\"]\n\nOne of mine was on Divine Focus; when I figured out that it worked at the beginning of EVERY turn and not just every FANATIC turn, it made a lot more sense as to why it had the (previously thought to be) RIDICULOUS 4 damage cost on it.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThose words are so easy to miss and yet can completely change the card.\n\nFor instance, I thought Ra&#39;s Imbued Fire (I think that&#39;s the name) changed <em>everyone&#39;s</em> damage type to Fire, not just the heroes.&nbsp; So for a while I was thinking, &quot;Why would I ever play this card?&nbsp; It gives everyone, villains included a +1 damage buff.&nbsp; Maybe if I wanted the game over faster?&quot;\n",
