      "created_at": "2014-01-05T07:27:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just today me and my cousin realized that Fixer's Driving Mantis can only redirect once per turn. Explains why he's seemed like such a beast while my cousin was playing him, he won against normal spite almost single-handedly by redirecting everything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The funny thing is, I think when I was playing him in my solo games I only redirected once, but when my cousin was playing I somehow missed the rules botch</p>",
